# Language-model drafting for report-card comments — entirely optional.
#
# With no key set, the app works exactly as it does today: comments are drafted
# by the structured on-device drafter and nothing leaves the building. The
# "Inspect what would be sent" button still works without a key, so you can
# review the payload before deciding anything.
#
# Set this in your hosting provider's environment settings (Vercel: Project →
# Settings → Environment Variables). Do NOT commit a real key to the repo.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to claude-sonnet-5.
ANTHROPIC_COMMENT_MODEL=
